  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_STRUCTURAL_ORGANISATION_IN_ANIMALS_DIAGRAM_IMAGE_Q02 - Internal viscera and digestive system organs</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The schematic diagram given below represents the internal visceral organs and digestive tract of a frog with parts labeled as A, B, C, and D:</p>
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 380" width="100%" height="380" style="max-width: 460px; background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; display: block; margin: 10px auto;">
