  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_STRUCTURAL_ORGANISATION_IN_ANIMALS_DIAGRAM_IMAGE_Q03 - Anatomical components of male reproductive system</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The diagram given below depicts the male reproductive system of a frog with anatomical parts designated by A, B, C, and D:</p>
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 370" width="100%" height="370" style="max-width: 440px; background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; display: block; margin: 10px auto;">
